{"id":"n73810-2-10","stage":4,"title":"잇달다 · 接连","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73810-2-10-1","ko":"지난주에 이어서 또 사고가 났어.","zh":"继上周之后，又发生了事故。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난주에","meaning":"上周","explanation":"지난주：上周；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난주","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58105","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이어서","meaning":"接续，维持，继承","explanation":"잇다：接续，维持，继承；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"잇다","audio":"/audio/c74dcf5ee23c448d7e09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24748","senseId":"2","lemma":"잇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사고가","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났어.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7d3f1e161caf0a72","term":"지난주","zh":"上周","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3","entryId":"58105","definition":"本周的前一周。","pronunciation":["지난주"]},{"id":"c74dcf5ee23c448d","term":"잇다","zh":"接续，维持，继承","audio":"/audio/c74dcf5ee23c448d7e09.mp3","entryId":"24748","definition":"不间断，继续保持。","pronunciation":["읻ː따"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d801ce1dc2aeee941d12.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73810-2-10-2","ko":"안 좋은 일이 잇달아 생기네.","zh":"坏事接连不断啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잇달아","meaning":"接连，相继","explanation":"잇달다：接连，相继；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잇달다","audio":"/audio/efd46a11551266a70fdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73810","senseId":"2","lemma":"잇달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생기네.","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"dfc